          "filename": "Yester Castle - geograph.org.uk - 873896.jpg",
          "caption": "Yester Castle The remains of a 13 C tower house, hardly visible through the trees, and surrounded on three sides by steep valleys.Built in 1297 by Hugo de Gifford, the so-called Wizard of Yester. Beneath is the sizeable Goblin Ha', where Gifford is said to have made magic.",
